    "chunk_text": "y cynerice be su\u00fean Temese, & Her for se here to Lundenbyrig from Readingum, & \u00fe\u00e6r wintersetl nam, & \u00fea namon Mierce fri\u00fe Her for se here on Nor\u00fehymbre, & he nam wintersetl on Lindesse \u00e6t Tureces iege, & \u00fea namon Her for se here from Lindesse to Hreopedune, & \u00fe\u00e6r wintersetl nam, & \u00feone cyning Burgr\u00e6d ofer & he for to Rome & \u00fe\u00e6r ges\u00e6t & his lic li\u00fe on Sancta Marian ciricean on Angelcynnes scole; & \u00fey ilcan geare hie sealdon anum unwisum cyninges \u00feegne Miercna rice to haldanne, & he him Her for se here from Hreopedune, & Healfdene for mid sumum \u00feam here on Nor\u00fehymbre.",
